    "media:imagetext": "0095BR4G.M03\nTai\npei - Kuala\nbum p\nSarapan Tengah Hari\nMinuman Kesihatan\nJus Buah-buahan\nBuah-buahan\nJogurt\nAyam Bungkus\nGorengan Ayam dan Sayur-sayuran Bersalut Penkek\nAtau\nTelur Dadar\nBerinti dengan Gorengan Sayur-sayuran Cara Timur\nBersama Bergedel Ikan\nAtau\nTaufu Szechuan\nTaufu Goreng Berempah\nMakanan Iringan\nBROKOLI DAN LOBAK MERAH\nCAMPURAN LADA BENGGALA\nKENTANG DELMONICO\nNASI GORENG SAYUR-SAYURAN\nPilihan Roti\nJem, Marmalad atau Madu\nMH 95 • LOS ANGELES - TAIPEI - KUALA LUMPUR\nLos Angeles - Taipei\nSupper\nMalaysian Satay\nOur Famous Charcoal Grilled Chicken and Beef Skewers\nTopped with Spicy Peanut Sauce\nAppetizer\nGrilled Tandoori Fish, Prawn Skewer and\nBeancurd Vegetable Parcel with Sweet Thai Chilli Sauce\nPan-fried Seafood\nSucculent Prawns and Sea Bass Marinated in Garlic, Oregano,\nBlack Pepper and Lemon Juice\nComplemented with Saffron Cream Sauce, Galette Potatoes\nand Grilled Vegetables Lightly Brushed with Olive Oil\nOr\nChicken Masala\nMorsels of Chicken Cooked in Select Herb and\nSpices Northern Indian Style\nDeliciously Served with Steamed Rice with Green Peas\nand Mixed Vegetables\nOr\nHomestyle Cheese in Butter and Spices\nA Delectable Vegetarian Dish of Cheese\nCooked in A Creamy Gravy of Select Spices\nAccompanied by Vegetable Pilaf\nSeasonal Fresh Fruits\nBread Selection\nThe food served on board is HALAL\nWe apologise if, on occasion, your choice is not available",
